    \item Engineered a multi-stage retrieval pipeline: folder-based priority scoring, \textbf{regex NLP} pulling vehicle make/model/year from natural language, dynamic ChromaDB filters, and \textbf{re-ranking} before LLM reasoning
    \item Built a multilingual (EN/CN/JP) ingestion pipeline for PDFs and Word docs of variable structure; debugged two production blockers --- ChromaDB schema validation failures and case-sensitive metadata filters
