    \item Curated the first publicly available labelled drum notation dataset --- 19,948 bar images from 264 songs across 19 drum types and 10 duration classes, split by song to prevent leakage and QC'd over 20+ sampling rounds
    \item Built the score editor in \textbf{TypeScript} with \textbf{VexFlow 5} inside an \textbf{Electron} desktop app: correct voice-split stem direction logic and note-level editing from rest through 32nd notes with beam linkages
\end{itemize}

\section{Leadership \& Activities}
\textbf{TAISP x MLDA Workshop Lead}, NTU School of Computing \hfill 2025 \\
